{v_1 : float} |= v_1 ≥ 0
>>
Rule 4 (stricter tolerance when using scalar broadcasting)
{v_1 : float, v_2 : tensor, v_3 : tensor} |= if (ndim(v_2) = 0 ∨ ndim(v_3) = 0) then v_1 > 0 else v_1 ≥ 0
